<div id="2026-10-31-coa-add-account-form" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-31 — Chart of Accounts has an add form</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Add Account on the chart page opens a form. Saving creates one account on the current site.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Add Missing Accounts never opened a screen. It only confirmed, then inserted the standard chart and redirected.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Controller/Accounting.pm</code>, <code>root/Accounting/coa/add.tt</code>, <code>root/Accounting/coa/list.tt</code></p>
</div>
